      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti bw’oboronge",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, omorwoti naoroke oragaambe ase oboronge, na abagaambi b’obogaambi mbagambe bakore ay’ekeene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera oyomo obo nabe buna obwebiso ekero omwaga okogusa, na buna ekeigamero ekero embura y’omoubera egotwa; boigo mbabe buna chindooche chire ase ense enyomo, na buna ekiriri ki’egetare ekenene ase ense etari namaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio amaiso ’abaanto abwo bakorora tagoukora, na amato ’abaanto abwo bakoigwa naigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto abwo batarenge ne chinkoro chi’oboremereria mbabe nebirengererio bi’okomanya, na abwo baarenge gotutura mbamanye gokwana buya na koigugwa buya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio omonto omoriri takorokwa omosike, gose omong’ainereria takorokwa omonto omwegenwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto omoriri nigo agokwana amang’ana ’oboriri; ebirengererio biaye nigo bigokora emeroberio y’ogokora ebibe; nigo akwenaria gokora aya atari e chingencho chinchenu; nigo agokwana bobe igoro y’Omonene, na otiga korageria abare nenchara, na orina abare nerang’o amaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebirwanero bi’omong’ainereria nigo bire ebi’obobe; ere nigo agokora emeroberio y’obosooku gosiria abachandegete ase okobateebera oborimo, nonya nekero barabwo bagokwana ay’oboronge bwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omonto omosike nigo akoroberia ay’obosike, na nigo agotenena ase ay’obosike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekiina na ogokorwa oboyia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abakungu mweisanegetie, imoka, montegerere! Inwe abaiseke motechandereti kende, tegerera, moigwe amang’ana ngokwana!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abakungu motechandereti kende, ekero amatuko aetanetie omwaka aerire mobe mogochandeka, ekiagera emesabibu tekwama, ne rigesa rie chindagera tirikoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio inwe abakungu motechandereti kende, iguswa, mwechabore chianga chiaino mobe getirianda, erio mweboyie chigunia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moake‐ake ebikuba biaino, ekiagera emegondo yaino emiya, na emesabibu yaino ekwama mono, yasarigwe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ekiagera amagwa na amageri biamerire ase ense y’abanto baane, mweake‐ake ase engencho ye chinyomba chi’emegoko chire ase omochie oyio oichire nomochengo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinyomba chi’oborwoti nchitigwe chire bosa, omochie oichire nabaanto nong’anywe, eburi na emerobiri y’obotengerero mbibe amakuruma kare na kare; agwo nao chitigere chi’orosana chiregokerie, na omochie oyio obe oborisia bw’amaicho e ching’iti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio ntoitererwe Omoika korwa igoro, na aase arenge erooro abe omogondo okwama chindagera chinyinge, na omogondo okwama chindagera chinyinge noonchorwe obe rinani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ekeene ngekorwe ase ense y’erooro, na oboronge bokorwe ase omogondo okwama chindagera chinyinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaratoke korwa ase oboronge nomorembe, na okwama kw’oboronge n’obotoereru na ogosemeria kwa botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baane mbamenye ase chinyomba chire nomorembe babe barendire buya, mbabe batimogete ase obotoereru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero embura y’amagena eraabe egotwa neiyerie emete ye rinani, na omochie oino noiranigwe inse mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imosesenirie inwe aba mogosimeka chimbusuro mbarabare ase amaache onsi, mogotiga chiombe ne chitigere chiagenda aande onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
